{"title": "Three Reads, Fast", "type": "Speed cheat sheet", "hooks": ["Three chart shapes, one line each. Don't blink, you'll miss one.", "You can read three chart shapes before this reel ends.", "Three chart shapes in a few seconds each. Keep up."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Three chart shapes, one line each. Don't blink, you'll miss one.", "text": "3 shapes. 1 line each.", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "One: a downtrend", "vo": "One. A downtrend. Lower highs and lower lows. It's only a trend until it stops. This one bounced 4.8 percent next.", "cues": [{"say": "Lower highs", "do": "mark", "i": 81, "label": "LH", "side": "high", "tone": "red"}, {"say": "lower lows", "do": "mark", "i": 75, "label": "LL", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}, {"say": "bounced 4.8 percent", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 1, "head": "Two: a hammer", "vo": "Two. A hammer. A long lower wick after a fall. Sellers pushed it down, buyers pushed it back.", "cues": [{"say": "A hammer", "do": "mark", "i": 87, "label": "H", "side": "low", "tone": "green"}], "win": [17, 99], "show": 87}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 2, "head": "Three: a rising wedge", "vo": "Three. A rising wedge. It points down. This one completed, then failed before its measured move. A pattern is a clue, not a promise.", "cues": [{"say": "It points down", "do": "zoom", "from": 70, "to": 95}, {"say": "then failed", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}], "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Save it. Practise it.", "vo": "Save this, and practise all three on real game charts at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Three chart shapes, one line each.\n\nA downtrend: lower highs and lower lows.\nA hammer: a long lower wick after a fall.\nA rising wedge: it points down, but it can still fail.\n\nSave this for your next chart.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStre